==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|ther-to-fore}}, {{m|enm|þeretofore}}, {{m|enm|þer to-fore}}, {{m|enm|þer toforn}}, {{m|enm|þær toforen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þǣr tōforan}}, equivalent to {{af|en|there|tofore}}.

